.env*

# ...except the test placeholders, which are committed on purpose. They carry no
# secret and resolve to nothing; without them `pnpm test:run` fails on a clean
# clone, because src/lib/supabase.ts throws at module init. See Sprint D.14.
!.env.test
!.env.example
